Package: imagestitcher
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ImageStitcher contributors
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxft2, libfontconfig1
Description: Lightweight image stitching application
 Stitch images horizontally or vertically with smart proportional resizing,
 spacing, backgrounds, quality controls, preview, and drag-and-drop support.
